WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.912
Sulayman was Dawud's son. Allah gave him special gifts: understanding the speech of animals, and command over the wind.

2
00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:16.000
One day, his great army marched through a valley. Sulayman heard a little ant crying out, Ants, hurry home, or the army will crush you!

3
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.448
Sulayman smiled. He halted the army to let the ants get home first, and thanked Allah for His blessing.

4
00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:27.936
The wind obeyed Sulayman, carrying him over the seas and across the mountains.

5
00:00:28.336 --> 00:00:35.344
Allah also made the jinn obey Sulayman. They came like drifting smoke and built him a splendid palace.

6
00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:40.304
The jinn dove into the deep sea and brought up pearls and jewels for Sulayman.

7
00:00:40.704 --> 00:00:46.824
The gifts Allah gives must be used for good. Wisdom and kindness are the most precious treasures of all.
